    "Open the same preloaded seekable input and compare public format, stream and chapter dictionaries, ordered case-insensitively within each dictionary.",
    "Compare format title and MuxingApp encoder alongside the representable text tags. Global creation_time belongs to the existing matroska-segment-metadata catalogue comparison.",
    "Compare the published chapter ID, start, end and time base, and the visible chapter title and targeted tags. The source oracle covers nested chapters, chapter display languages, binary tags, WritingApp, source flags and precise target identities.",
